                                                "sense_id": "d5f731f5-4743-3f22-8155-e42f6e3372e9",
                                                "text": "‘Jazzing?’ Temple whispered […]. ‘Yes, putty-face!’ the woman said. ‘How do you suppose I paid that lawyer?’"
